Reasoning (Pseudocode):

```pseudocode
// Input: Number of new players = 48
// Input: Number of returning players = 6
// Input: Group size = 6

// Calculate the total number of players
totalPlayers = newPlayers + returningPlayers

// Calculate the number of groups
numberOfGroups = totalPlayers / groupSize

// Output: Number of groups
print numberOfGroups
```

Calculation:

Total players: 48 + 6 = 54
Number of groups: 54 / 6 = 9

\boxed{9}

